  {% set _mmax = (_mtd.sectors | map(attribute='share_pct') | max) if _mtd.sectors else 1 %}
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('Where the heat is', '热度集中在哪') }}</h2>
    <div class="lead" style="margin-bottom:8px">
      {% for sec in _mtd.sectors %}
      <div class="leadrow">
        <span class="sm">{{ sec.sector }}</span>
        <span class="leadbar">
          <i style="left:0;width:{{ (sec.share_pct / _mmax * 100)|round(1) }}%;background:var(--up)"></i>
        </span>
        <span class="sm" style="text-align:right">{{ sec.share_pct }}%</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% if _mtd.sample %}
    <div style="margin-bottom:8px">
      {% for tk in _mtd.sample %}
      <span class="chip">{{ tk }}</span>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="sm" style="margin:0 0 6px">{{ t(
      'When the hottest stocks crowd into one sector, a stumble there hits them all together.',
      '当最热个股集中于单一板块时，该板块受挫会同时波及所有热门股。') }}</p>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:0">
      <span class="l-en">{{ momo.disclosure_en }}</span>
      <span class="l-zh">{{ momo.disclosure_zh }}</span>
    </p>
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  <!-- Market breadth (index-member participation, not factor breadth) -->
  {% if breadth and breadth.groups %}
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('Market breadth', '市场广度') }}
      {{ help("Share of index members trading above their own 50-day AND 200-day moving averages, across the S&P 500 / 400 / 600 caps. This is MARKET-MEMBER participation (is the rally broad or narrow?), NOT factor-portfolio breadth. Above ~60% = broad; a small/large divergence flags where participation is rotating. Small & mid breadth history starts 2023-07 (the divergence is on that common window).", "指数成分中股价同时高于自身 50 日与 200 日均线的比例，覆盖标普 500／400／600。这是市场成分的参与度（涨势是广泛还是狭窄），并非因子组合广度。约 60% 以上=广泛；大小盘背离提示参与度在轮动。中小盘广度数据自 2023-07 起。") }}
    </h2>
    <table>
      <tr><th>{{ t('index', '指数') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('% > 50d MA', '% 高于50日线') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('% > 200d MA', '% 高于200日线') }}</th><th class="r">{{ t('members', '成分数') }}</th></tr>
      {% for g in breadth.groups %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ t(g.label_en, g.label_zh) }}</td>
        <td class="r"><span class="bbar"><i style="width:{{ g.p50 }}%;background:{{ 'var(--up)' if g.p50>=50 else 'var(--down)' }}"></i></span> <b class="{{ 'pos' if g.p50>=50 else 'neg' }}">{{ g.p50 }}%</b></td>
        <td class="r"><span class="bbar"><i style="width:{{ g.p200 }}%;background:{{ 'var(--up)' if g.p200>=50 else 'var(--down)' }}"></i></span> <b class="{{ 'pos' if g.p200>=50 else 'neg' }}">{{ g.p200 }}%</b></td>
        <td class="r muted sm">{{ g.n }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% if breadth.div_small_large is not none %}
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:8px 0 0">{{ t(
      'Small-cap vs large-cap breadth: ' ~ ('%+.1f'|format(breadth.div_small_large)) ~ 'pp (small minus large, % above 50d). Positive = small-caps participating MORE than mega-caps — a broadening tape; negative = leadership narrowing to the top.',
      '小盘相对大盘广度：' ~ ('%+.1f'|format(breadth.div_small_large)) ~ ' 个百分点（小盘减大盘，% 高于50日线）。正值=小盘参与度高于大盘（涨势扩散）；负值=领先向头部集中。') }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fx-sec" id="sec-evidence">
    <div class="sec-h"><span class="sec-n">03</span><h2>{{ t('The evidence', '证据') }}</h2></div>
    <p class="sec-sub">{{ t('The honest test most factor dashboards never show — every factor rebuilt at each quarter-end from only what was knowable then. Judge each number against zero.', '大多数因子面板从不展示的诚实检验——每个因子在各季末仅用当时可知的信息重建。每个数字都应与零比较。') }}</p>
  <!-- Does the rank actually predict? — leak-free point-in-time IC scorecard -->
  {% if ic and ic.rows %}
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('Do these rankings actually predict? — the honest test', '这些排名真的能预测吗？— 诚实检验') }}
      {{ help("The honest test most factor dashboards never show. At each quarter-end we rebuild every factor AS IT WAS KNOWABLE THEN — no look-ahead into a not-yet-filed 10-K (fundamentals are point-in-time) — then rank-correlate the factor score with the NEXT " ~ ic.horizon_d ~ "-day return: the Information Coefficient (IC). mean IC = average predictive edge; 0 = none. IC-IR (annualized) = IC ÷ its own volatility; t_HAC = Newey-West t-stat (overlapping forward windows autocorrelate the IC series); q_FDR = Benjamini-Hochberg false-discovery rate across every factor screened. One caveat the deep panel can't escape: prices cover only the currently-listed (delisted names are absent), so the deep read is survivorship-biased — an OPTIMISTIC bound. Judge each number against ZERO.",
                "大多数因子面板从不展示的诚实检验。在每个季末，我们按当时可知的信息重建每个因子（无前视、基本面为时点数据），再将因子分数与未来 " ~ ic.horizon_d ~ " 日回报做秩相关，得到信息系数 IC。平均 IC = 平均预测优势；0 = 无优势。IC-IR（年化）= IC ÷ 自身波动；t_HAC = Newey-West t 值（重叠窗口使 IC 序列自相关）；q_FDR = 跨全部因子的多重检验错误发现率。深度面板的一个无法回避的代价：价格仅覆盖现存名（已退市名缺失），故深度读数含幸存者偏差 — 为乐观上界。每个数字都应与零比较。") }}
    </h2>
    {# The verdict itself now leads the page (see the hero ruler); repeating it
       here in prose was the same sentence twice. This panel is the receipt: the
       full statistics behind that verdict. #}
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:0 0 10px">
      {{ t('Deep 2011-2026 test · survivor-tilted data, so treat results as an optimistic upper bound.',
           '2011-2026 深度检验 · 数据含幸存者偏差，结果应视为乐观上界。') }}
      {{ help(
        (('Span ' ~ ic.span ~ ' · ' ~ ic.rebalances ~ ' quarterly rebalances · ~' ~ ic.median_universe ~ ' names — a DEEP 2011-2026 re-test on a backfilled close panel, not the ~3y rolling cache. The catch: that panel is SURVIVORSHIP-BIASED (delisted names absent — free prices only cover the currently-listed), so it is an OPTIMISTIC bound; a lone, marginal survivor is shown, not a green light. SUE — the strongest factor on the shallow 2023-2025 window — collapses to IC≈0 here. FINRA short-interest is dropped (no point-in-time history) and fundamentals refresh only ~annually, so fundamental factors still have few independent draws.') if ic.survivorship_biased else ('Span ' ~ ic.span ~ ' · ' ~ ic.rebalances ~ ' quarterly rebalances · ~' ~ ic.median_universe ~ ' names. ~3 years of price history caps the sample at n≈' ~ ic.rebalances ~ ', so t-stats and FDR are low-power. Read it as honest context, not a green light — and note fundamentals refresh only ~annually, so the fundamental factors have even fewer independent draws.')),
        (('区间 ' ~ ic.span ~ ' · ' ~ ic.rebalances ~ ' 次季度再平衡 · 约 ' ~ ic.median_universe ~ ' 只 — 2011-2026 深度复检。含幸存者偏差：已退市名缺失，为乐观上界；仅展示个别勉强通过者，而非买入信号。') if ic.survivorship_biased else ('区间 ' ~ ic.span ~ ' · ' ~ ic.rebalances ~ ' 次季度再平衡 · 约 ' ~ ic.median_universe ~ ' 只。约 3 年价格历史使样本仅 n≈' ~ ic.rebalances ~ '，t 统计与 FDR 检验力较低。'))
      ) }}
    </p>
    {% set _comp = ic.factors.get('composite') if ic.factors else none %}
    {% if _comp and _comp.get('mean_ic') is not none and _comp.mean_ic < 0 %}
    <div class="ic-alert">
      <b>⚠ {{ t('The equal-weight composite has NEGATIVE predictive IC.', '等权综合因子的预测 IC 为负。') }}</b>
      {{ t('Its blended mean IC is ' ~ ('%+.4f'|format(_comp.mean_ic)) ~ ' over ' ~ ic.rebalances ~ ' quarters — the naive all-factor blend INVERTS the cross-section on this panel, so it is worse than useless as a stock screen. Do NOT trade the composite. Judge each factor on its own row below: only a factor tagged FDR-PASS (survives BH-FDR AND positive mean IC) clears that statistical screen, and even that is a marginal survivor on a survivorship-biased panel.',
           '其混合平均 IC 为 ' ~ ('%+.4f'|format(_comp.mean_ic)) ~ '（' ~ ic.rebalances ~ ' 个季度）— 朴素的全因子等权混合在此面板上反转了横截面，作为选股信号还不如不用。切勿交易该综合因子。请按下方每个因子各自的行判断：仅标记为 FDR-PASS（通过 BH-FDR 且平均 IC 为正）的因子通过该统计筛选，且即便如此也只是幸存者偏差面板上的勉强通过者。') }}
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <table>
      <tr>
        <th>{{ t('factor','因子') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('mean IC','平均 IC') }}{{ help('average predictive edge; 0 = none', '平均预测优势；0 = 无优势') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('IC-IR (ann)','IC-IR（年化）') }}{{ help('IC ÷ its own volatility, annualized — how consistent the edge is', 'IC ÷ 自身波动（年化）——优势的一致性') }}</th>
        <th class="r">t<sub>HAC</sub>{{ help('Newey-West t-stat: accounts for overlapping return windows', 'Newey-West t 值：修正重叠窗口的自相关') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('hit','命中率') }}{{ help('fraction of quarters the IC was positive', 'IC 为正的季度占比') }}</th>
        <th class="r">q<sub>FDR</sub>{{ help('Benjamini-Hochberg false-discovery rate across all factors screened', 'BH 错误发现率（跨全部因子）') }}</th>
        <th class="r">n{{ help('number of quarterly rebalances', '季度再平衡次数') }}</th>
      </tr>
      {% for r in ic.rows %}
      {% set _vs = 'validated' if (r.survives_fdr and r.mean_ic is not none and r.mean_ic > 0) else ('negative-ic' if (r.mean_ic is not none and r.mean_ic < 0) else 'fdr-fail') %}
      <tr>
        <td><span class="fx-open" data-fx="{{ r.factor }}">{{ t(r.label_en, fac.factor_labels.get(r.factor, r.label_en)) }}</span><span class="val-chip {{ _vs }}">{% if _vs == 'validated' %}{{ t('FDR-PASS','通过FDR') }}{% elif _vs == 'negative-ic' %}{{ t('NEG-IC','反向') }}{% else %}{{ t('FDR-FAIL','未过检') }}{% endif %}</span></td>
        <td class="r {{ 'pos' if r.mean_ic and r.mean_ic > 0 else ('neg' if r.mean_ic and r.mean_ic < 0 else 'muted') }}">{{ '%+.4f'|format(r.mean_ic) if r.mean_ic is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="r {{ 'pos' if r.ic_ir_ann and r.ic_ir_ann > 0 else ('neg' if r.ic_ir_ann and r.ic_ir_ann < 0 else 'muted') }}">{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.ic_ir_ann) if r.ic_ir_ann is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="r muted">{{ '%+.2f'|format(r.t_hac) if r.t_hac is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="r muted">{{ '%.0f%%'|format(r.hit * 100) if r.hit is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="r muted">{{ '%.2f'|format(r.q_fdr) if r.q_fdr is not none else '—' }}</td>
        <td class="r muted">{{ r.n }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </table>
    {% if ic.collinearity and ic.collinearity.top_pairs %}
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:10px 0 0">
      {{ t('Crowding / overlap','拥挤／重叠') }}{{ help("Factors that move together are redundant (a 'crowded' tilt). Mean absolute pairwise factor correlation, raw vs after Löwdin de-correlation; the composite (de-correlated) row above strips this overlap. VIF > 5 would flag a factor that is a linear combination of the others.", "彼此同向移动的因子是冗余的（拥挤的押注）。下为平均 |因子相关性|（原始 vs Löwdin 去相关后）；上方“综合（去相关）”行已剔除该重叠。VIF>5 表示某因子是其它因子的线性组合。") }}:
      {{ t('mean |corr| ' ~ ic.collinearity.mean_abs_corr_raw ~ ' raw → ' ~ ic.collinearity.mean_abs_corr_orth ~ ' de-correlated.',
           '平均 |相关性| ' ~ ic.collinearity.mean_abs_corr_raw ~ ' 原始 → ' ~ ic.collinearity.mean_abs_corr_orth ~ ' 去相关后。') }}
      {# display labels, not the engine's factor keys (`low_vol ↔ low_beta`) #}
      {% for p in ic.collinearity.top_pairs %}<span class="chip">{{ fac.factor_labels.get(p.a, p.a) }} ↔ {{ fac.factor_labels.get(p.b, p.b) }} · {{ p.corr }}</span>{% endfor %}
    </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}
  <!-- Factor performance — point-in-time portfolios (P3 return-series) -->
  {% if series and series.factors %}
  <div class="panel">
    <h2>{{ t('Factor performance — point-in-time portfolios', '因子表现 — 时点组合') }}
      {{ help("Each factor built into a daily PORTFOLIO at every month-end, as it was knowable then (no look-ahead): long-only = cap-weighted top quintile with a 5% single-name cap; long/short = equal-weight top-minus-bottom quintile (a paper factor premium, NOT a shortable book). Long-only carries with the market (compare SPY); the long/short isolates the premium. " ~ series.honesty, "在每个月末，将每个因子构建为日度组合（无前视）：纯多头=市值加权顶部五分位（单股5%上限）；多空=等权顶部减底部五分位（纸面因子溢价，非可做空组合）。" ~ series.honesty) }}
    </h2>
    <p class="muted sm" style="margin:0 0 10px">{{ t(
      'Rebased over ' ~ series.history_start ~ '→' ~ series.as_of ~ ' (' ~ series.n_rebalances ~ ' month-ends). Free fundamentals are ANNUAL, so fundamental ranks refresh only ~yearly — most turnover is the price legs (low-vol/low-beta). Every Sharpe ships with a block-bootstrap 95% CI that mostly straddles zero, and at most a lone, marginal factor clears FDR (see the IC panel above). Descriptive, not tradeable.',
      '区间 ' ~ series.history_start ~ '→' ~ series.as_of ~ '（' ~ series.n_rebalances ~ ' 个月末）。免费基本面为年度数据，故基本面排名约每年才刷新一次 — 多数换手来自价格类因子（低波动/低贝塔）。每个夏普均附 block-bootstrap 95% 置信区间（多数跨越零），且至多个别勉强因子通过 FDR（见上方 IC 面板）。仅作描述，不可交易。') }}</p>
    <div class="scroll"><table>
      <tr>
        <th>{{ t('factor','因子') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('long-only trend','纯多头走势') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('LO cum','纯多头累计') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('LO Sharpe','纯多头夏普') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('Q5−Q1 cum','多空累计') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('Q5−Q1 Sharpe (95% CI)','多空夏普（CI）') }}</th>
        <th class="r">{{ t('P(Sharpe>0)','P(夏普>0)') }}</th>
      </tr>
