     the same thing every night and will keep saying it until ≥2027. Replaced by
     the two things that actually change: what the factor lane currently tells the
     cortex, and how far it is from earning more say. ──────────────────────── #}
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="topline" style="margin-bottom:10px">
      <h2 style="margin:0">{{ t("What this feeds", "本页如何接入系统") }}
        {{ help(
          "Factor intelligence is context-only inside the Neural Web: it explains style-regime context and flags attention candidates, but it never ranks, scores, or originates a signal (RUL-NW7). Influence is earned through graded probation against pre-registered gates, never self-asserted — the meters below are that probation, counted honestly. The five registered hypotheses (H1 factor_weather conditioning, H2 Pair-G severity, H3 cross-section alibi, H4 attention earn-in, H5 leader/macro alignment) stay BH-WITHHELD until the family-wide FDR sweep runs.",
          "因子智能在神经网络中仅作为背景：解释风格体制背景、标记关注候选项，但从不排名、评分或发起信号（RUL-NW7）。影响力须通过预注册关卡的分级试用赚取，不可自我主张——下方计量即为该试用过程。五项已注册假设在家族 FDR 整体检验完成前保持 BH-WITHHELD 状态。") }}
      </h2>
