        <b>{{ fac.factor_labels.get(_lk, _lk) }}</b>{% if _nw_fw.get('style_regime') %}, in a
        <b>{{ _nw_fw.get('style_regime') }}</b> style regime held {{ _nw_fw.get('style_regime_hold_days', 0) }} days{% endif %}.
        {% if _lic is not none %}That same lean has a measured edge of {{ '%+.3f'|format(_lic) }} — {% if _lic < 0 %}
        the wrong way round, so it is context to explain the tape with, never a reason to buy it.{% else %}
        close enough to zero to be context, not a reason to buy.{% endif %}{% endif %}</span>
      <span class="l-zh">当前它只向系统传达一件事：市场正偏向<b>{{ fac.factor_labels.get(_lk, _lk) }}</b>{% if _nw_fw.get('style_regime') %}，风格体制为<b>{{ _nw_fw.get('style_regime') }}</b>，已持续 {{ _nw_fw.get('style_regime_hold_days', 0) }} 天{% endif %}。
        {% if _lic is not none %}该偏向的实测优势为 {{ '%+.3f'|format(_lic) }}——{% if _lic < 0 %}方向为负，因此只能用于解释行情，绝非买入理由。{% else %}接近于零，属于背景信息而非买入理由。{% endif %}{% endif %}</span>
