        <p class="acc-sub">{{ t(
          'Times the factor lane has raised its hand and had the call graded afterwards. It cannot be granted any real influence before 25 — it is marked in shadow until then.',
          '因子通道主动提示并在事后被评级的次数。满 25 次前不会被授予任何实际影响力，此前仅以影子模式运行。') }}</p>
